-- title:
--   Patching data from complete-intersection presentations over 𝒪
-- statement:
--   Let $\mathcal O$ be a discrete valuation domain that is adically complete for its maximal ideal, let $\ell$ and $r$ be natural numbers, and write $B = \mathcal O[[X_0,\dots,X_{r-1}]]$ for `MvPowerSeries (Fin r) 𝒪`. Let $R$ be a commutative $\mathcal O$-algebra which is finite and free as an $\mathcal O$-module, and assume there are $r$ elements $f_0,\dots,f_{r-1}$ of $B$ such that $B/(f_0,\dots,f_{r-1})$ is isomorphic to $R$ as an $\mathcal O$-algebra. Let $M$ be an $R$-module that is finite and free over $R$. Then [`Algebra.PatchingDatum 𝒪 ℓ r R M`](def/Algebra_PatchingDatum.html#L39) is nonempty: there is, for every $n$, a level consisting of a $B$-module $N$, an $\mathcal O$-algebra endomorphism $\varphi$ of $B$, a surjective $\mathcal O$-algebra map $\psi : B \to R$ with $\psi(\varphi(X_i)) = 0$ for all $i$, and a surjective additive map $\pi : N \to M$ with $\pi(f\cdot x) = \psi(f)\,\pi(x)$ whose kernel is exactly $\bigl(\varphi(X_0),\dots,\varphi(X_{r-1})\bigr)N$, together with $d$ elements $b_1,\dots,b_d$ of $N$ such that every $x \in N$ is $\sum_i \varphi(c_i)\cdot b_i$ for some $c_i \in B$, and $\sum_i \varphi(c_i)\cdot b_i = 0$ holds precisely when every $c_i$ lies in the ideal generated by the $(1+X_j)^{\ell^n} - 1$. No primality of $\ell$ is assumed.
--
--   This is the converse direction of the Taylor–Wiles patching criterion: a complete-intersection presentation of $R$ with as many relations as variables, together with freeness of $M$ over $R$, produces a patching datum for the pair $(R,M)$, so that the patching-datum notion captures exactly this class of pairs. It is used in [`Algebra.PatchingDatum.exists_module_of_bijective_of_exists_presentation`](thm.html#Algebra.PatchingDatum.exists_module_of_bijective_of_exists_presentation) and in [`GaloisRep.DeformationRingData.exists_patchingDatum_of_ladder`](thm.html#GaloisRep.DeformationRingData.exists_patchingDatum_of_ladder).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Algebra_PatchingDatum_nonempty_of_exists_presentation_of_free.lean

